kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873050/extras/b3e02d2b1e019511b8ae417722667ce7.avif?t=1780963187\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br>Dynamic airship battle system that allows you to experience real-time combat in the skies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873050/extras/8e6747e163d004dbc1297e3521723f04.avif?t=1780963187\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br>30+ fully animated creatures in the game, some of them can be gained via quests and can be commanded with command scrolls, then summoned at the barracks. (*not all enemies can be turned into party units) When you buy command scrolls at the barracks, and then use a command scroll, it has a 15% chance of sucking the soul of special enemies in, then it turns into a command card. From there you can summon that particular creature at the barracks. Did we mention plenty of crazy bosses to fight!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873050/extras/6f9508aacd33e349041159dd893f1864.avif?t=1780963187\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br>Three controllable party members called &quot;Party Units&quot;, mix and match them, level them up. The barracks buildings can be found in any major Empire or town, and is used to summon your party units. *Each class starts off with their own unique party units that either start with them based on quest or can be summoned at the barracks. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873050/extras/87a0efe6bce65ff2901bb77c9855a574.avif?t=1780963187\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br>Experience combat with up to four friends local COOP.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873050/extras/d4b09ae63e960