dtrack.</strong>", "short_description": "&quot;As above, so below, discover the mysteries of the hollow&quot;. Step into the world of Anthropia. Will you help the empires of the world, or destroy them? 4 different classes with unique stories, &amp; 12+ party units to summon at the barracks. (Build an Empire, Custom Party, Deep character stories)", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873050/header.jpg?t=1780963187", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780963187", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780963187", "website": "http://crescenthollowgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> On board</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> On board</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></